teacher_info.about_teacher:
- A qualified teacher of English and Chinese with 8 years of teaching experience;
- Fluent in 4 languages;
- My students come from more than 15 countries; 
- A certificate in psycholinguistic( to put it simple, I know how your brain works when you learning a new language); 
- Psychological education.


Apart  from improving your English, you will get: 

- Proven techniques how to memorise words;
- Exercises that improve your pronunciation;
- You will understand how your brain works and be able to overcome obstacles on the road to English/Chinese fluency such as fears, patterns, doubts etc.

teacher_info.teaching_style:
- Your confidence will skyrocket;
- English will naturally become an integral part of your life; 
- You will be able to keep improving your English on your own with pleasure;
- You will learn how to achieve your language goals and hopefully life goals too;
- You will use your English speaking skills to actually change your job, get a promotion, move to another country, find love etc.
- You will change your life for better, you will become successful and happy.

 Isn't a final goal of learning a foreign language?

