pro_course_detail.description:
Who
🌀Teenagers and adults 
🌀Levels A1 - C2

📚ORGANIZATION OF THE COURSE!📚

There are approximately from 100 to 120 units for each level. The material is organized in grammatical categories, such as:
 📌tenses; 
📌questions;
📌articles;
Units aren't ordered according to difficulty, and can be selected and used in the order appropriate for the learner(s). There are also supplementary exercises. 

📚Looking forward to seeing you in my classes!📚

Who
🌀Teenagers and adults 
🌀Levels A1 - C2

📚ABOUT THE COURSE:📚

📬Every activity in every lesson includes a speaking task to ensure students maximize their opportunity to develop confident conversation skills;

📬There're also video clips which show students how to use target language in real-life settings;

📬In each two-page lesson, students learn key Vocabulary, practice these new words and develop structured speaking skills through the Conversation activity, study new functional language in the Language Booster section, and then develop either Pronunciation or Listening skills in preparation for a communicative Speak with Confidence activity;

📬Communicating with confidence means expressing yourself accurately, fluently, and appropriately. So don't miss out this excellent opportunity to improve your speaking skills!

📚Looking forward to seeing you in my classes!📚
